.problem
1) Program designed to run on special hardware and
therefore restricted distribution to manufacturing
only. WPS 80 product line has systems with up to 4
LQP printers and would like to use this program on
their kit.
.solution
A two location patch will allow the program to be
run on the WPS80/WPS200 and be included in the
zf0016 kit. The patch will allow the use of device
codes 650x thru 653x.
